{
  "name": "@zframes/providers-keyless",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "description": "The keyless zframes market-data provider set as a single composition factory \u2014 imports the 27 free, no-key provider packages and returns them in capability-routing order. Shared by every app that mounts the runtime (apps/runtime, apps/explorer) so the keyless set lives in one place instead of a duplicated per-app list.",
